{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOU DIE TODAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a dungeon-crawling adventure that combines the strategic depth of deck-building with the thrill of rolling dice. Inspired by the magic of tabletop RPGs, this game brings you a unique rogue-like experience where every roll counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/Basic_Attack.gif?t=1741156488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/Enemy_Attack.gif?t=1741156488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deck-Building with a Twist:</strong> Collect powerful cards with unique abilities and build your ultimate deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/Market_Delete.gif?t=1741156488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dice of All Kinds:</strong> Use D4s, D6s, D8s, D12s, and even D20s to unleash devastating effects. The dice you roll can trigger card effects, grant extra bonuses, or turn the tide in encounters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/Chest_Open.gif?t=1741156488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tabletop-Inspired Gameplay:</strong> Feel the excitement of rolling dice and making critical decisions, just like in classic tabletop fantasy games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/Add_1.gif?t=1741156488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Encounters:</strong> Face off against fantastical foes, tackle challenges, and discover secrets hidden in the dungeon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/Bomb.gif?t=1741156488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayability:</strong> Each run offers a new combination of cards, dice, and choices, ensuring no two adventures are alike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/D4_Attack_Close._Up.gif?t=1741156488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/D8_Attack.gif?t=1741156488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you forge your path to victory or will the dungeon claim you? Test your strategy and luck in this fresh take on the rogue-like genre!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/Cocoon_Spawn.gif?t=1741156488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why This Game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love the strategic depth of card games, the thrill of rolling dice, and the immersive storytelling of games like <i>Dungeons &amp; Dragons</i> or <i>Baldur\u2019s Gate 3</i>, this game is designed for you. We've crafted a unique experience that captures the spirit of tabletop fantasy and brings it to life in a rogue-like format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/Level_Up.gif?t=1741156488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/Crit_Fail.gif?t=1741156488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will &quot;<strong><i>YOU DIE TODAY</i></strong>&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/extras/Gold_Dice.gif?t=1741156488\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434040?t=1741156488","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741156488","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/a2c2ffbbab7e37f174e724109fce1f141baef8ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741156488","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434040/a2c2ffbbab7e37f174e724109fce1f141baef8ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741156488","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3527770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOU DIE TODAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a dungeon-crawling adventure that combines the strategic depth of deck-building with the thrill of rolling dice. Inspired by the magic of tabletop RPGs, this game brings you a unique rogue-like experience where every roll counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta